{"id":"vod_bf_42386","vodId":"42386","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"樱花庄的宠物女孩","name_cn":"樱花庄的宠物女孩","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-43/06e79232a4650aea00f7476356a49847.jpg"},"summary":"由于违反了宿舍规定而被逐出住所的神田空太（松冈祯丞 配音）带着自己的爱猫流落在街头，不得已，他只能够住进了人称“问题学生集中营”的老旧宿舍——樱花庄。果然，接二连三出现的怪人让空太更加确信了流言的可信度，但在相处的同时，空太也发现，虽然身为问题学生，但樱花庄稀奇古怪的住 客们其实都有着天真和善良的心地。　　202号房的椎名真白（茅野爱衣 配音）梦想着成为一名漫画家，只能画一手好原画的她一直都苦于剧情的构思。201号房的上井草美咲（高森奈津美 配音）由于过于专注于动画的制作，而被认为浪费了画漫画的才能。103号房的三鹰仁（樱井孝宏 配音）在女性之间有着极高的人气。203号房的青山七海（中津真莉子 配音）以其过于执拗的性格荣幸成为了整个樱花庄最正常的一员。在这些怪人的围绕下，空太和猫咪们的崭新生活开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:07:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yinghuazhuangdechongwunvhai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://